{
  "id": "2CH.29",
  "number": "29",
  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Chronicles 29",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiah became king of Judah at the age of 25, and he ruled in Jerusalem for 29 years. His mother was Abijah, the daughter of Zechariah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Following the example of his ancestor King David, he did what was pleasing to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the first month of the year after Hezekiah became king, he re-opened the gates of the Temple and had them repaired. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He assembled a group of priests and Levites in the east courtyard of the Temple ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and spoke to them there. He said, “You Levites are to consecrate yourselves and purify the Temple of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of your ancestors. Remove from the Temple everything that defiles it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Our ancestors were unfaithful to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God and did what was displeasing to him. They abandoned him and turned their backs on the place where he dwells. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They closed the doors of the Temple, let the lamps go out, and failed to burn incense or offer burnt offerings in the Temple of the God of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because of this the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has been angry with Judah and Jerusalem, and what he has done to them has shocked and frightened everyone. You know this very well. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Our fathers were killed in battle, and our wives and children have been taken away as prisoners.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I have now decided to make a covenant with the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, so that he will no longer be angry with us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My sons, do not lose any time. You are the ones that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has chosen to burn incense to him and to lead the people in worshipping him.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The following Levites were there:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.12+2CH.29.13+2CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.12",
              "2CH.29.13",
              "2CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.12+2CH.29.13+2CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.12",
              "2CH.29.13",
              "2CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These men assembled their fellow-Levites, and they all made themselves ritually clean. Then, as the king had commanded them to do, they began to make the Temple ritually clean, according to the Law of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Then, as the king",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Then they began to make the Temple ritually clean, as the king, who was acting at the LORD's command, had ordered them to do.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priests went inside the Temple to purify it, and they carried out into the temple courtyard everything that was ritually unclean. From there the Levites took it all outside the city to the valley of the Kidron.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The work was begun on the first day of the first month, and by the eighth day they had finished it all, including the entrance room to the Temple. Then they worked for the next eight days, until the sixteenth of the month, preparing the Temple for worship.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Levites made the following report to King Hezekiah: “We have completed the ritual purification of the whole Temple, including the altar for burnt offerings, the table for the sacred bread, and all their equipment. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We have also brought back all the equipment which King Ahaz took away during those years he was unfaithful to God, and we have rededicated it. It is all in front of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s altar.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Without delay King Hezekiah assembled the leading men of the city, and together they went to the Temple. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As an offering to take away the sins of the royal family and of the people of Judah and to purify the Temple, they took seven bulls, seven sheep, seven lambs, and seven goats. The king told the priests, who were descendants of Aaron, to offer the animals as sacrifices on the altar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priests killed the bulls first, then the sheep, and then the lambs, and sprinkled the blood of each sacrifice on the altar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Finally they took the goats to the king and to the other worshippers, who laid their hands on them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the priests killed the goats and poured their blood on the altar as a sacrifice to take away the sin of all the people, for the king had commanded burnt offerings and sin offerings to be made for all Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king followed the instructions that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had given to King David through Gad, the king's prophet, and through the prophet Nathan; he stationed Levites in the Temple, with harps and cymbals, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "instruments like those that King David had used. The priests also stood there with trumpets. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiah gave the order for the burnt offering to be presented; and as the offering began, the people sang praise to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and the musicians began to play the trumpets and all the other instruments. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Everyone who was there joined in worship, and the singing and the rest of the music continued until all the sacrifices had been burnt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then King Hezekiah and all the people knelt down and worshipped God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The king and the leaders of the nation told the Levites to sing to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the songs of praise that were written by David and by Asaph the prophet. So everyone sang with great joy as they knelt and worshipped God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiah said to the people, “Now that you are ritually clean, bring sacrifices as offerings of thanksgiving to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".” They obeyed, and some of them also voluntarily brought animals to be sacrificed as burnt offerings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They brought seventy bulls, 100 sheep, and 200 lambs as burnt offerings for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they also brought 600 bulls and 3,000 sheep as sacrifices for the people to eat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Since there were not enough priests to kill all these animals, the Levites helped them until the work was finished. By then more priests had made themselves ritually clean. (The Levites were more faithful in keeping ritually clean than the priests were.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In addition to offering the sacrifices that were burnt whole, the priests were responsible for burning the fat that was offered from the sacrifices which the people ate, and for pouring out the wine that was presented with the burnt offerings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And so worship in the Temple was begun again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King Hezekiah and the people were happy, because God had helped them to do all this so quickly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "2CH.30",
    "number": "30",
    "bookId": "2CH"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "2CH.28",
    "number": "28",
